      "writtenOn": "2025-02-21T15:55:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This check is to exclude the AOT compiler from the DCHECK.\n\nTo give you some background, what I\u0027m trying to do is to keep an existing property, that is, **at runtime**, if the DexCache is from an **app image** or dynamically created, then the DexCache location matches the DexFile location. As this CL is about loading the app image generated by Cloud Compilation, I don\u0027t want this CL to break this property because existing code may assume this property and do something \"smart\" based on that (e.g., using the DexCache location to locate the dex file on disk). I\u0027m adding this DCHECK to make sure this property is still held.\n\nI excluded the AOT compiler because I can\u0027t see how this CL can break this property for the AOT compiler. This property is probably held for the AOT compiler as well, but I don\u0027t want to check for it in this CL because it\u0027s out of scope.\n\nAdded a TODO.",
